From: ws07 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 15:34:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/18] Screens (workstream 07): the page's S1 village card in
 Chromium, with the connected states

ws07-s1-card.screen.mjs opens screens/ws07/s1-card.html, which renders the
page's own renderS1Village on S1 data in the herald's shapes: a caravan past
its arrival turn says it is overdue and not concluded (not arrived), nothing else is added when
no source is registered, and with 04's, 05's and 01's sources registered as
mocks each state is said with a symbol and words and the cooperation button
works by keyboard. Not the whole page and not chain data.

It also moves 0005's screen harness (screens/ws07/s1-parts.mjs, ws07-s1.screen.mjs)
to the five arrival states of 0006. Needs 0005 and 0006.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
